<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <style>
    body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333; }
    .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; }
    .header { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1C96C1 0%, #157a9e 100%); color: white; padding: 30px; text-align: center; border-radius: 5px 5px 0 0; }
    .content { background-color: #f9f9f9; padding: 30px; border-radius: 0 0 5px 5px; border: 1px solid #ddd; border-top: none; }
    .info-box { background-color: #e3f2fd; padding: 15px; margin: 20px 0; border-radius: 5px; }
    .button { display: inline-block; background-color: #1C96C1; color: white; padding: 12px 24px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 5px; margin: 20px 0; }
    .unsubscribe { font-size: 12px; color: #666; margin-top: 30px; padding-top: 20px; border-top: 1px solid #ddd; }
    .unsubscribe a { color: #1C96C1; }
    .footer { margin-top: 30px; text-align: center; font-size: 12px; color: #666; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="header">
      <h2>🎉 Thank You for Subscribing!</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="content">
      <p>Hello {{name}},</p>
      <p>You're now subscribed to the PropertyArk newsletter! We're thrilled to have you with us.</p>

      <div class="info-box">
        <strong>What you'll receive:</strong>
        <ul>
          <li>Latest property listings and market updates</li>
          <li>Exclusive offers and promotions</li>
          <li>Real estate tips and insights</li>
          <li>Platform news and feature announcements</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <p>We send emails about once or twice a month — no spam, we promise!</p>

      <p>Welcome aboard,<br><strong>The PropertyArk Team</strong></p>

      <div class="unsubscribe">
        <p>Don't want to receive these emails anymore? You can 
          <a href="{{unsubscribeUrl}}">unsubscribe here</a> anytime.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="footer">
      <p>© {{currentYear}} PropertyArk. All rights reserved.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>